---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const integrationEmailLink = "mailto:tracker.rivieraapps@gmail.com?subject=Help%20integrating%20L%C3%A9rins%20AI&body=Hi%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20integrate%20L%C3%A9rins%20AI%20on%20my%20website.%20My%20website%20is%20%5Badd%20your%20website%20URL%5D.%20Could%20you%20help%20me%20get%20started%3F";
---

<Layout title="Get Started | Lérins AI" description="Install Lérins AI on your website in under a minute, then test the live AI concierge on this page.">
  <main class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pb-14 pt-16 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600">Start in 60 seconds</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">Put Lérins AI on your website</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Test the assistant below, then copy one lightweight script tag into your site. It works with WordPress, Shopify, React, and plain HTML.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 pb-20 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] lg:px-8">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 font-bold text-white">1</span><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">Add the script</h2></div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Paste this before the closing <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-blue-600">&lt;/body&gt;</code> tag on your website.</p>
          <pre class="mt-4 min-w-0 max-w-full overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap break-words rounded-lg bg-slate-950 p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-blue-200"><code>&lt;script src="https://lerins.rivieraapps.com/plugin.js" async&gt;&lt;/script&gt;</code></pre>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 font-bold text-white">2</span><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">Customize the assistant</h2></div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Update the widget configuration for your name, colors, welcome message, quick replies, and business knowledge. The default demo is ready to test on this page.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 font-bold text-white">3</span><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-950">Go live</h2></div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Deploy your site and let Lérins AI answer common questions, qualify interest, and guide visitors while you focus on the work.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-blue-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-lg">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600">Live demo</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold text-slate-950">Ask Lérins AI anything</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-600">The chat button is in the bottom-right corner. Open it and try one of the suggested questions, or ask how the widget would help your business.</p>
        <div class="mt-8 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 p-5">
          <p class="font-semibold text-slate-950">Try asking:</p>
          <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700">
            <li>“How do I install Lérins AI on WordPress?”</li>
            <li>“Can it answer questions about my products?”</li>
            <li>“What does the free plan include?”</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-slate-500">The demo uses the same <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-blue-600">plugin.js</code> file you can embed on your own site.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-blue-600 px-4 py-16 text-center text-white sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold sm:text-4xl">Need help integrating Lérins AI?</h2>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-blue-100">Email us your website address and we’ll help you add the assistant and get it ready to go live.</p>
        <a href={integrationEmailLink} class="mt-8 inline-flex w-full max-w-sm items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-blue-700 shadow-lg transition hover:bg-blue-50 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white sm:w-auto">Email us to integrate <span class="ml-2" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <script is:inline src="/plugin.js"></script>
</Layout>
